%N A358023 Number of partitions of n into at most 2 distinct squarefree parts.
%H A358023 Robert Israel, <a href="/A358023/b358023.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%p A358023 f:= proc(n)
%p A358023       nops(select(k -> NumberTheory:-IsSquareFree(k) and NumberTheory:-IsSquareFree(n-k), [$1..(n-1)/2]))
%p A358023       + `if`(NumberTheory:-IsSquareFree(n),1,0)
%p A358023 end proc:
%p A358023 f(0):= 1:
%p A358023 map(f, [$0..80]); # _Robert Israel_, Nov 10 2026
